#: scenario9:scenario9_46706B49_29D8_4537_B65A_0914A867078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39fc7fb84a060ef773129733f5fe23b20418c0e5f91661f9ca83725ac54eef54
