msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the flaxen-haired girl would have been able to let go of her "
"yearning for her brother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私がいなければ……、⟪k:1⟫亜麻色の髪をした少女は、⟪k:2⟫兄に対する思慕を諦められたはずです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b6fd3deee11952d8bf8ad315da3650c4c7e33a8e7208a58975de27bd4419627
