msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the shipwrecked merchant’s lover would not have lost her place as "
"his tether."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私がいなければ……、⟪k:1⟫海辺の街の女性は、⟪k:2⟫彼の最初の鎖のままでいたはずです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_67FA079F_C169_4B07_9CED_0EC33DBAB5BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12058ee229c96f713f26633a0a03548bd8f987c8df43438dcdc9e9f7c2913184
