msgid "⟪k:0⟫You always acted... ⟪k:1⟫out of the good of your heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫むしろ……、⟪k:1⟫善意で動き続けてきた……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_3553894F_EA73_4C5E_BD18_85D9258CD87B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1968a0af6991fff11510435892a5a04546897325e1d0470d0487afd705020c
