#: scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f5825266eee02c1ca2e1e78a6a28ab2dad2260dd9fba65eb7e8299bd662e163
#. default-sha256: 9d761e550d83a3d1982f67da93657d0323a67951dae3484f26d10134ee8dd652
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But there’s more to the story than that, Michel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫ミシェル……。⟪k:2⟫その答えには、⟪k:3⟫まだ続きがあるのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40b896d3f0e70ffaf8437f2645a16e72b2a092eee5b0b7ef65fd7761e079d7e8
#. default-sha256: bf81b47ef77b2890aed7489736130c27ecf3306b417587e864e6e8ac621046d3
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her identity as a saint gave her purpose in life,⟪k:1⟫while simultaneously constraining her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なによりも、⟪k:1⟫その人生を縛り付けるものであったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a4a3222e0fc712a2b1d232c56a8ad1fb1c0bf55c479f68afeefdbc94517c0f8
#. default-sha256: debc1c33d4c8d88ff0eb186d7327f4982d7f5e1d1cb07da0477a5911752cf042
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then she severed that part of her soul."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私に乗せて、⟪k:1⟫切り離したのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5cbf074582ce2e48cbadb017a3ad5cc833e6951ed874a19ed7df158d071fc64
#. default-sha256: a4cab1e5cc42b480c001a74e656bcf6658ed0109186b39441085e9eeb29c8a3c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no longer a part of Morgana, but something entirely separate. ⟪k:1⟫However, I wasn’t "
"“me” yet, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その瞬間――、⟪k:1⟫私はモルガーナの一部ではなく、⟪k:2⟫別の存在になりました。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ただ、"
"⟪k:5⟫最初は……私の存在そのものも無かったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 944f602c8bc2a769360513efa3e55d231284bbaee7d4d91f48041d457663b1f6
#. default-sha256: 59ca22dfb7fbc49389778aea81cbdd0172b4aeea54a3b0bd84f5f3e672c67cd6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But eventually, that dust gained a sense of self,⟪k:1⟫taking form as a human soul,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれどその物質のひとつが、⟪k:1⟫意思を持ち形を作り……人の魂となってしまったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D103C95F_E067_4B9E_A23E_5D1E2174843E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb04d79a040254e0669edec2685fb0ad2ca008009739b20bc07eaeff1d3cce38
